<title>AUSTRIA: Austria natbank allots 9.84 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria natbank allots 9.84 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 9.84 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged fixed rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 12 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 8.68 billion schillings in repos, or 10 percent of the bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
